flags read:
  diagonalCost=uniform [verified: SRD 5.2.1 p.13 "Playing on a Grid": any adjacent square costs 1; alternating 5/10 is a 2024 DMG option (its use for range is unverified)]
  initiativeMode=roll [verified: SRD 5.2.1 p.184 "Initiative" and p.254: static initiative is a GM option]
  groupInitiative=shared [verified: SRD 5.2.1 p.13: a group of identical creatures gets one roll]
  monsterHp=listed [verified: SRD 5.2.1 p.255: use the number or the dice, the GM's choice]
  statBlockAtZeroHp=dies [verified: SRD 5.2.1 p.17 "Monster Death": dies at 0 HP unless the GM treats it like a character]
  corpseSpace=clear [UNVERIFIED: SRD 5.2.1 p.14 and glossary "Dead" (p.180) are silent on bodies; Sage Advice silent]
  moveBetweenAttacks=all [UNVERIFIED: SRD 5.2.1 p.177 "Moving between Attacks" plus p.257 (Multiattack is part of the Attack action): an inference for Multiattack]
  focusHandSomatic=strict [verified: 2024 Sage Advice SAC-SpellComponents3 and SRD 5.2.1 p.105-106: the focus hand does Somatic only for spells with a Material component; lenient is a common table ruling]
  conjuredHandEffectBlocksHand=false [UNVERIFIED: SRD 5.2.1 p.156 Produce Flame: the flame is "in your hand"; unlike Flame Blade (p.132) it never says it needs or occupies a free hand]
  areaOriginOnGrid=squareCenter [UNVERIFIED: Shane's table ruling 2026-11-01 (areas land on a square); SRD 5.2.1 has no grid-area rule; the 2024 DMG intersection rule is known only secondhand]
  areaGridCoverage=atLeastHalfSquare [UNVERIFIED: SRD 5.2.1 has no grid-area rule (p.13 covers movement and range); the 2024 DMG half-square rule is known only secondhand; 2024 SAC-Spells-CloudofDaggers1]
  areaSaveGroupingPerEvent=groupByEvent [UNVERIFIED: SRD 5.2.1 p.16: one damage roll for targets that save at the same time; silent on creatures caught by one moved area]
  movedAreaTriggersAlongPath=sweepPath [UNVERIFIED: SRD 5.2.1 p.150-151 "moves into its space" has no path rule; 2024 parallels (p.132, p.201) count spaces along the way]
  unconsciousDropsShield=true [UNVERIFIED: SRD 5.2.1 p.191 Unconscious: drops whatever it's holding; a shield is carried in one hand; a donned shield is unruled]
  zoneKnowledge=sawCast [UNVERIFIED: Not a rule: which zones a creature avoids when it plans a move. sawCast (coverage step 9) = a hidden zone (SRD 5.2.1 p.164 Spike Growth, srd-raw.txt:31015-31021: camouflaged; a creature that can't see the area when the spell is cast must take a Search action to recognize it) only once it saw it appear or recognized it, every other zone once it has line of sight to one of its squares (or saw it appear); all = every zone; none = only zones it created. Movement cost through Difficult Terrain is physical and applies either way]
  losMethod=corners [UNVERIFIED: SRD 5.2.1 "Cover" (srd-raw.txt:1995-2032) and its glossary entry (33044-33050) give the three degrees and say a target benefits only when the effect "originates on the opposite side of the cover", but give no grid procedure. corners = the DMG's corner-to-corner lines (the attacker's best corner to the 4 corners of the target's square: 1-2 blocked Half, 3 Three-Quarters, 4 Total; known only secondhand, the DMG is not SRD); centers = one line between square centers; stubbed = no cover and everyone sees everyone (the engine before M3 step 8, a what-if)]
  creatureCover=on [verified: SRD 5.2.1 Cover table (srd-raw.txt:2006-2017): Half Cover is offered by "Another creature or an object that covers at least half of the target"; off is a what-if]
